zztgo
!cmd/zztgo/
!cmd/zztgo/main.go
.idea/
*.ZZT
*.hex
*.HI
ZZT.DAT

# Locally generated worlds. persistGeneratedWorld (generation.go) writes four
# siblings per world — NAME.ZZT plus the prompt, plan and ZWD it was built from
# — into whatever directory it is pointed at, and `cmd/run-generation` points it
# here. `*.ZZT` above only caught the first of the four, so ten of the other
# three leaked into the tree. Anchored to this directory so the committed
# fixtures under testdata/ and promptkit_assets/fewshots/ are unaffected.
/*.plan.md
/*.prompt.txt
/*.zwd
